  "fetched_body": "Alone in the night\nOn a dark hill\nWith pines around me\nSpicy and still,\n\nAnd a heaven full of stars\nOver my head,\nWhite and topaz\nAnd misty red;\n\nMyriads with beating\nHearts of fire\nThat aeons\nCannot vex or tire;\n\nUp the dome of heaven\nLike a great hill,\nI watch them marching\nStately and still,\n\nAnd I know that I\nAm honored to be\nWitness\nOf so much majesty.",
